Subject: [PATCH] media: add compatibility for legacy MTK camera and audio

Change-Id: I7ea7af4dbdf472756cbef29d770c1ab70d3701af
(cherry picked from commit ff02732217586bee95f19ac401b1133d821c7213)
---
